<title>HONG KONG: Peregrine sets call warrants on property basket.</title>
<headline>Peregrine sets call warrants on property basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peregrine Derivatives Ltd said on Thursday it had launched 280 million call warrants on a basket of three blue-chip property stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> Cheung Kong (Holdings) Ltd		0.05 shrs</p>
<p> Henderson Land Development Co Ltd     0.05 shrs</p>
<p> Sun Hung Kai Properties Ltd	     0.05 shrs</p>
<p>Ten warrant control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	 HK$10.9	 PREMIUM	 11.9 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	  HK$0.2645     GEARING	 4.6x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	   29.JUN.98     MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT     HK$12.1</p>
<p> LISTING		HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
